            of categories with families and their morphisms, in which we aim to construct an initial object.
          %h2#type_structure Type structure
          %p
            Each type forming operation corresponds to structure on a CwF that can be expressed naturally in terms of categorical operations in the presheaf category
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
